      "body": "Home-regime measurement (harness PR #438): **NEGATIVE under the pre-declared rule** — content-K8 routed-backoff 34.6% vs flat 35.2% (−0.6pp; rule needed +2pp); K32 34.2%; oracle ceilings only 36.0–36.3% (barely above flat; flat evidence-hit already 90.1%). On the coherent home corpus, stratifying the evidence store adds nothing — the flat store already captures the evidence. **The stratification claim's real test is the broad corpus, which is now teacher-gated (#433's finding → #320)**: this issue stays open, scoped to re-measure once a suitable teacher generates a broad corpus. Recorded per discipline.",
